BRepClass3d: loading a solid into a classifier
(BRepClass3d_SolidExplorer::InitShape) makes an intersector for each face,
which samples the face's surface; one by one, that took most of the loading
of a solid of thousands of faces, which a union of many bodies loads several
times (the placement of its cavities in BOPAlgo_BuilderSolid, the checker's
BRepCheck_Solid; mitcad#1279). The intersectors are now made beside each
other (OSD_Parallel, from 64 faces on) and bound to their faces in the
faces' order, as before. The results are unchanged.
diff --git a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKTopAlgo/BRepClass3d/BRepClass3d_SolidExplorer.cxx b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKTopAlgo/BRepClass3d/BRepClass3d_SolidExplorer.cxx
